{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53509","headline":"赠卢洺州 · 杨巨源","name":"赠卢洺州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三刀梦益州，一箭取辽城。\n（见《白氏长庆集》卷十五《赠杨秘书巨源》自注）（按：《全唐诗》卷三三三收此二句，缺题，系源出《唐诗纪事》卷三五，今重录之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}